OL,3,GNEWSAVictim of cane corso dog attack
OL,4,Asought by police
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman who was attacked by two cane
OL,7,Fcorsos while walking her dog in a park
OL,8,Fhas been asked to come forward by the
OL,9,Fpolice.
OL,11,FDerbyshire Police said the incident,
OL,12,Fwhich involved two "large" brown cane
OL,13,Fcorsos, took place in Newhall Park,
OL,14,FSwadlincote, shortly after 08:00 BST on
OL,15,FFriday.
OL,17,FOfficers said the dogs "launched
OL,18,Fthemselves aggressively" at an elderly
OL,19,Fwoman, causing her to be knocked to the
OL,20,Ffloor.
OL,23,APub: 19-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
